{"slug":"css-text-gradient-animation","title":"用CSS3实现文字颜色渐变动画","date":"2021-06-22","tags":["CSS","HTML"],"category":"Front-end","excerpt":"如何用CSS3实现文字颜色渐变动画 效果如下： I have a dream @keyframes text-color-gradient { 0%{background-position:0% 50%} 50%{background-po","author":"Dongsheng Zhao","readingTime":1,"contentHtml":"<blockquote>\n<p>如何用CSS3实现文字颜色渐变动画</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>效果如下：</p>\n<span class=\"gradient-color-text\">\r\nI have a dream\r\n</span>\n<style>\r\n@keyframes text-color-gradient {\r\n  0%{background-position:0% 50%}\r\n  50%{background-position:100% 50%}\r\n  100%{background-position:0% 50%}\r\n}\r\n.gradient-color-text {\r\n  background-size: 400% 400%;\r\n  background-image: linear-gradient(to right, #ff0000, #ff8000, #fff200, #51ff00, #00d0ff, #9000ff,#ff008c);\r\n  -webkit-background-clip: text;\r\n  animation: text-color-gradient 10s ease infinite;\r\n  color: transparent;\r\n  font-size: 48px;\r\n}\r\n</style>\n<h3 id=\"思路\">思路</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>使用<code>-webkit-background-clip: text;</code>实现背景渐变按照文字裁剪</li>\n<li>使用<code>@keyframes</code>定义动画关键帧配合<code>background-position</code>属性，移动渐变色背景位置</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h3>\n<h3 id=\"gradient-text-html\">gradient-text-html</h3>\n<div class=\"svp-code-block-wrapper\"><div class=\"svp-code-block\">\n    \n    <pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light night-owl\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#011627;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#d6deeb\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#7FDBCA\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#1E754F;--shiki-dark:#CAECE6\">span</span><span style=\"color:#B07D48;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#C5E478;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#7FDBCA\">=</span><span style=\"color:#B5695977;--shiki-dark:#D9F5DD\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\">gradient-color-text</span><span style=\"color:#B5695977;--shiki-dark:#D9F5DD\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#7FDBCA\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">I have a dream</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#7FDBCA\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#1E754F;--shiki-dark:#CAECE6\">span</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#7FDBCA\">></span></span></code></pre>\n    <div class=\"svp-code-block--lang\">html</div>\n    <button class=\"svp-code-block--copy-btn\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><span class=\"svp-code-block--copy-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"svp-code-block--check-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg></span></button>\n    \n  </div>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"gradient-text-css\">gradient-text-css</h3>\n<div class=\"svp-code-block-wrapper\"><div class=\"svp-code-block\">\n    \n    <pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light night-owl\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#011627;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#d6deeb\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\">@</span><span style=\"color:#1E754F;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#C792EA;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">keyframes</span><span style=\"color:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#D7DBE0\"> text-color-gradient</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">  0%</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">{</span><span style=\"color:#998418;--shiki-dark:#80CBC4\">background-position</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">:</span><span style=\"color:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#F78C6C\">0</span><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#FFEB95\">%</span><span style=\"color:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#F78C6C\"> 50</span><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#FFEB95\">%</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">  50%</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">{</span><span style=\"color:#998418;--shiki-dark:#80CBC4\">background-position</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">:</span><span style=\"color:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#F78C6C\">100</span><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#FFEB95\">%</span><span style=\"color:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#F78C6C\"> 50</span><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#FFEB95\">%</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">  100%</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">{</span><span style=\"color:#998418;--shiki-dark:#80CBC4\">background-position</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">:</span><span style=\"color:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#F78C6C\">0</span><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#FFEB95\">%</span><span style=\"color:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#F78C6C\"> 50</span><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#FFEB95\">%</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#C5E478\">.</span><span style=\"color:#B07D48;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#C5E478;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">gradient-color-text</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#998418;--shiki-dark:#80CBC4\">  background-size</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">:</span><span style=\"color:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#F78C6C\"> 400</span><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#FFEB95\">%</span><span style=\"color:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#F78C6C\"> 400</span><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#FFEB95\">%</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#998418;--shiki-dark:#80CBC4\">  background-image</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">:</span><span style=\"color:#998418;--shiki-dark:#C5E478\"> linear-gradient</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">(</span><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#7FDBCA\">to</span><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#FF6363\"> right</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">,</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#F78C6C\"> #</span><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#FFEB95\">ff0000</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">,</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#F78C6C\"> #</span><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#FFEB95\">ff8000</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">,</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#F78C6C\"> #</span><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#FFEB95\">fff200</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">,</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#F78C6C\"> #</span><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#FFEB95\">51ff00</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">,</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#F78C6C\"> #</span><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#FFEB95\">00d0ff</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">,</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#F78C6C\"> #</span><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#FFEB95\">9000ff</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">,</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#F78C6C\">#</span><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#FFEB95\">ff008c</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#998418;--shiki-dark:#C5E478\">  -webkit-background-clip</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">:</span><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#FF6363\"> text</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#998418;--shiki-dark:#80CBC4\">  animation</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">:</span><span style=\"color:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\"> text-color-gradient </span><span style=\"color:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#F78C6C\">10</span><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#FFEB95\">s</span><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#FF6363\"> ease</span><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#FF6363\"> infinite</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#998418;--shiki-dark:#80CBC4\">  color</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">:</span><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#FF6363\"> transparent</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#998418;--shiki-dark:#80CBC4\">  font-size</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">:</span><span style=\"color:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#F78C6C\"> 48</span><span style=\"color:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#FFEB95\">px</span><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#999999;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">}</span></span></code></pre>\n    <div class=\"svp-code-block--lang\">css</div>\n    <button class=\"svp-code-block--copy-btn\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><span class=\"svp-